    "markdown": "![Hugging Face's logo](https://huggingface.co/front/assets/huggingface_logo-noborder.svg) Hugging Face⟨1⟩\n  *  Models ⟨2⟩\n  *  Datasets ⟨3⟩\n  *  Spaces ⟨4⟩\n  *  Buckets new⟨5⟩\n  *  Docs ⟨6⟩\n  *  Enterprise ⟨7⟩\n  * Pricing⟨8⟩\n  *     * Website\n      *  Tasks⟨9⟩\n      *  HuggingChat⟨10⟩\n      *  Collections⟨11⟩\n      *  Languages⟨12⟩\n      *  Organizations⟨13⟩\n    * Community\n      *  Blog⟨14⟩\n      *  Posts⟨15⟩\n      *  Daily Papers⟨16⟩\n      *  Hardware⟨17⟩\n      *  Learn⟨18⟩\n      *  Discord⟨19⟩\n      *  Forum⟨20⟩\n      *  GitHub⟨21⟩\n    * Solutions\n      *  Team & Enterprise⟨7⟩\n      *  Hugging Face PRO⟨22⟩\n      *  Enterprise Support⟨23⟩\n      *  Inference Providers⟨24⟩\n      *  Inference Endpoints⟨25⟩\n      *  Storage Buckets⟨5⟩\n  * * * *\n  * Log In⟨26⟩\n  * Sign Up⟨27⟩\n\n\n# \n ![](https://cdn-avatars.huggingface.co/v1/production/uploads/61682c431f210a77f67690ac/2waqKXFlMbr8SGggfoPmk.png) ⟨28⟩\nLLM-OS-Models⟨28⟩\n/\ndsc-370m-v4-5b-fineweb-edu⟨29⟩\nlike 0\nFollow\n![⟨30⟩] LLM-OS-Models 12\n Text Generation ⟨31⟩ English ⟨32⟩ gated-deltanet ⟨33⟩ linear-attention ⟨34⟩ long-context ⟨35⟩ DSC ⟨36⟩ chunk-routing ⟨37⟩\nLicense: apache-2.0\n Model card ⟨29⟩ Files Files and versions xet ⟨38⟩ Community ⟨39⟩\nCopy to bucket new\n  * DSC v4 370M — FineWeb-Edu 5B pretrain⟨40⟩\n    * Architecture (DSC v4)⟨41⟩\n    * Training⟨42⟩\n    * Loading (custom architecture)⟨43⟩\n    * Evaluation⟨44⟩\n    * Files⟨45⟩\n\n\n#   ⟨40⟩ DSC v4 370M — FineWeb-Edu 5B pretrain \nContinued pretrain of a custom **DSC (Distributed Sparse Chunk-routing)** variant built on GatedDeltaNet (GDN-2) 370M. This is the **v4 architecture** trained for 5B tokens on FineWeb-Edu.\n##   ⟨41⟩ Architecture (DSC v4) \n  * Base: GDN-2 370M (16 layers, d_model=1024)\n  * chunk_size=256, topk=2 routing\n  * alpha learnable init=0.5 (final avg=0.2656)\n  * desc_attn_v (descriptor attention value)\n  * ent_bias_scale=0 (entropy bias disabled)\n\n\n##   ⟨42⟩ Training \n  * **Tokens** : 5,000,000,000 (5B)\n  * **Data** : FineWeb-Edu sample\n  * **Optimizer** : AdamW lr=3e-4, weight_decay=0.01, cosine schedule\n  * **Batch** : 2/GPU x 8 = eff_batch 16, seq=4096\n  * **Hardware** : 8x H100 80GB (DDP)\n  * **Time** : ~9h (5B tokens @ ~155K tok/s)\n\n\n##   ⟨43⟩ Loading (custom architecture) \nThis is NOT a standard HF Transformers checkpoint. Load with the project's DSC code:\nThe DSC implementation is at: <https://github.com/gyunggyung/LLM-OS-Models> (under ).\n##   ⟨44⟩ Evaluation \nAfter pretrain (before any fine-tune), RULER NIAH @ 4K:  \n| task  | accuracy_token  | note  |  \n| --- | --- | --- |  \n| niah_single_1  | 0.0175  | sparse needle, hardest for routing  |  \n| niah_multikey_1  | 0.0813  | 1 needle, 1 distractor  |  \n| niah_multikey_2  | 0.0700  | 2 needles, 2 distractors  |  \n| niah_multikey_3  | 0.0799  | 3 needles, 4 distractors  |  \nThe model has routing infra but doesn't use it effectively (decorative routing pattern). A2 fine-tune (NIAH memory-only aux loss) recovers single_1 to 0.65+ in 100M tokens. See .\n##   ⟨45⟩ Files \n  * — PyTorch state_dict (2.0GB, bf16)\n  * — alpha/router stats snapshot\n\nDownloads last month\n    \n-     \nDownloads are not tracked for this model. How to track ⟨46⟩\nInference Providers NEW⟨47⟩\n Text Generation ⟨48⟩\nThis model isn't deployed by any Inference Provider. 🙋 Ask for provider support⟨49⟩\nSystem theme\nCompany\nTOS⟨50⟩ Privacy⟨51⟩ About⟨52⟩ Careers⟨53⟩ ⟨1⟩\nWebsite\nModels⟨2⟩ Datasets⟨3⟩ Spaces⟨4⟩ Pricing⟨8⟩ Docs⟨6⟩\nInference providers allow you to run inference using different serverless providers.\n",
